@node The Lists
@chapter The Lists
@cindex lists
@cindex tabulated lists

The six tabulated lists share the pagination, sorting and filtering model
described in @ref{Buffers and Navigation}.  Each names its own buffer,
binds @kbd{g} to refresh and @key{RET} to drill in, and (except Dolt)
@kbd{/} to a filter transient.

@menu
* Rigs::          @code{gascity-rig-list}.
* Sessions::      @code{gascity-session-list}.
* Convoys::       @code{gascity-convoy-list}.
* Orders::        @code{gascity-order-list}.
* Mail::          @code{gascity-mail-inbox}.
* Dolt::          @code{gascity-dolt-list}.
@end menu

@node Rigs
@section Rigs
@findex gascity-rig-list

@file{*gascity-rigs*}, in @code{gascity-rig-list-mode}: columns
@emph{Name}, @emph{Prefix}, @emph{Status}, @emph{Branch}, @emph{Store}.

@shot{rig-list-light, The rig list (ef-cyprus)}

@table @kbd
@item @key{RET}
@kindex RET @r{(rig list)}
@findex gascity-rig-dashboard-at-point
Open the rig's dashboard.
@item b
@kindex b @r{(rig list)}
Open the rig's beads in beads.el.
@item d
@kindex d @r{(rig list)}
Dired into the rig directory.
@item s
@kindex s @r{(rig list)}
Suspend the rig (@code{gc rig suspend}).
@item r
@kindex r @r{(rig list)}
Resume the rig (@code{gc rig resume}).
@item R
@kindex R @r{(rig list)}
Restart the rig (@code{gc rig restart}; confirms, as it kills the rig's
agent sessions).
@item /
@kindex / @r{(rig list)}
Filter by status (running, suspended, stopped).
@end table

@node Sessions
@section Sessions
@findex gascity-session-list

@file{*gascity-sessions*}, in @code{gascity-session-list-mode}: columns
@emph{Agent}, @emph{Rig}, @emph{State}, @emph{Provider}, @emph{Working
dir}.

@shot{session-list-dark, The session list (ef-elea-dark)}

@table @kbd
@item @key{RET}
@kindex RET @r{(session list)}
@findex gascity-tmux-at-point
Attach the agent's tmux session (also @kbd{t}).
@item i
@kindex i @r{(session list)}
Open the agent's detail view (@pxref{Session Detail}).
@item d
@kindex d @r{(session list)}
Dired into the worktree.
@item M
@kindex M @r{(session list)}
Nudge the agent.
@item s @r{/} K @r{/} w @r{/} D
@kindex s @r{(session list)}
@kindex K @r{(session list)}
@kindex w @r{(session list)}
@kindex D @r{(session list)}
Suspend / kill / wake / drain.
@item v
@kindex v @r{(session list)}
Peek at recent output.
@item /
@kindex / @r{(session list)}
Filter by state (active, suspended, closed, all --- server-side) and rig
(client-side substring).
@item W
@kindex W @r{(session list)}
@findex gascity-session-list-toggle-auto-refresh
Toggle automatic refresh.  When
@code{gascity-session-list-auto-refresh} is on (the default), the list
re-reads @code{gc session list} every
@code{gascity-session-list-auto-refresh-interval} seconds (5 by default)
--- but only while its buffer is displayed in a visible window: a buried
list does nothing, and a tick is skipped while a previous read is still
in flight, so a slow remote link is never perpetually restarted.
@end table

